				11,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(Mist): Clarify TODOs as DEPENDENCY comments for Hickory DNS\n\nThis commit updates comment prefixes in server.rs and zone.rs from `TODO:` to `DEPENDENCY:` to more accurately reflect the nature of the outstanding work.\n\nThe NxProofKind configuration for DNSSEC NSEC/NSEC3 support and the record insertion implementation via the Authority trait's update method are dependent on the upstream Hickory DNS library's API and behavior, rather than being internal implementation tasks.\n\nThis clarification helps distinguish between internal implementation work (TODOs) and external library dependencies (DEPENDENCIES) that may require upstream contributions or version updates to resolve.",
